00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:27.900
Now, why does that matter?

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:29.040
I know what you're thinking.

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:31.170
Food and energy, that's gas and food,

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:32.880
what I buy at the store, what I eat

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:34.260
that's most of what I spend my money on

00:02:34.260 --> 00:02:36.210
