increased in March.

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:50.730
And so that tells you

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:53.580
that what the Fed's doing isn't
having the intended effect.

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:56.610
So this chart, these two
charts really just illustrating

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:58.140
the difference that we are seeing

00:02:58.140 --> 00:02:59.697
between the overall CPI

00:02:59.697 --> 00:03:03.090
and inflation and the core
inflation, what the Fed watches

00:03:03.090 --> 00:03:05.670
and what the Fed thinks of as a predictor

00:03:05.670 --> 00:03:08.550
or a kind of indicator of
where inflation is headed.

00:03:08.550 --> 00:03:11.280
If that's correct, inflation
